From d96918a2cddf801cc97895c6bf01da89b1a0d55f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 20:06:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Shopee order sync and dispatch automation
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds a full Shopee Open Platform integration on top of the app the
seller already has authorized ("DRE Shopee"):

- shopeeClient.js: signs and sends Shopee Open Platform v2 requests
  (OAuth auth-url generation, code-for-token exchange, token refresh,
  shop-scoped signed requests). Supports separate live/sandbox
  partner id+key pairs via env vars.
- shopeeSync.js: pulls ready-to-ship orders from a connected shop,
  upserts them into app.orders (channel='shopee'), and runs them
  through the existing internal quote engine so freight is priced
  from the TMS's own tables — no dependency on Shopee's logistics
  channel approval for this part. Also handles dispatch: calls
  get_shipping_parameter + ship_order + get_tracking_number against
  Shopee and records the resulting shipment/tracking code in
  app.shipments.
- shopeeIntegration.js (routes): auth-url endpoint, OAuth callback
  (public, Shopee redirects the browser here after the merchant
  authorizes), shop listing, manual sync trigger, and dispatch
  endpoint.
- 007_shopee_integration.sql: app.shopee_shops table (per-account
  OAuth tokens), RLS policy matching the rest of the schema.
- quotes.js: exported createAndCalculateQuote/hashRequest so the
  Shopee sync can reuse the same quoting logic used by the manual
  and automatic quote endpoints, instead of duplicating it.

Configured for sandbox (SHOPEE_IS_SANDBOX=true) to test against the
shop's own test account before touching the live shop.

